   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Write the difference quotient: \\( \\lim_{h \\to 0} \\frac{f(2 + h) - f(2)}{h} \\), with \\( f(2 + h) = h^{3} + 6 h^{2} + 18 h + 29 \\) and \\( f(2) = 29 \\).",
